# autom9-backend

FastAPI backend for the autom9 Tableau extension. Handles admin configuration, BYOM LLM credential management, workflow config, integration health checks, and session tracking.

## What it does

autom9 is a Tableau extension that lets consultants interact with an AI agent for planning workflows — submitting Smartsheet requests, creating Google Calendar invites, and surfacing open work opportunities — without leaving Tableau.

This backend serves:
- **Admin API** — BYOM credential setup (OpenAI/Anthropic), JSON workflow config upload
- **Status API** — parallel integration health checks on extension load
- **Session API** — session creation tied to Tableau user context
- **Config API** — public endpoint the extension fetches on load to get active workflow tools/instructions

## Tech stack

- Python 3.11+ with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
- FastAPI + Uvicorn (async)
- SQLAlchemy 2.0 async ORM + asyncpg + PostgreSQL
- Alembic migrations
- Pydantic v2 + pydantic-settings
- Fernet symmetric encryption (credentials at rest)
- pytest + pytest-asyncio (real DB, savepoint-based test isolation)

## Project structure

```
