tests/
  api/                 # Integration tests (real DB, savepoint rollback per test)
  config/              # Unit tests for WorkflowRegistry
  integrations/        # Tests for IntegrationBase stubs
```

## Environment variables

| Variable | Description |
|---|---|
| `DATABASE_URL` | `postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@host:5432/dbname` |
| `ENCRYPTION_KEY` | Valid Fernet key (44-char base64url). Generate: `uv run python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())"` |
| `BACKEND_SECRET` | Shared secret for `X-Autom9-Token` admin header |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | `INFO`, `DEBUG`, etc. |
| `DATABASE_POOL_BASE` | Connection pool size (recommended: 5) |
| `DATABASE_POOL_OVERFLOW` | Max overflow connections (recommended: 20) |
| `CORS_ORIGINS` | Comma-separated allowed origins (default: `http://localhost:5173`) |

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in values before running.

## Running locally

```bash
# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Run migrations
uv run alembic upgrade head

# Start dev server
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

## Running tests

Tests require a live PostgreSQL instance with database `autom9_test`:

```bash
# Run all tests
uv run pytest tests/ -v

# Run a specific test file
uv run pytest tests/api/test_admin_config.py -v

# Run with coverage
uv run pytest tests/ --cov=app --cov-report=term-missing
```

The test suite uses real database connections with savepoint-based rollback — each test starts from a clean state without dropping/recreating tables.

## API overview

| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/health` | — | Liveness check |
| `GET` | `/api/health` | — | Liveness check |
| `GET` | `/api/status` | — | Parallel integration health checks |
| `POST` | `/api/sessions` | — | Create session (called on extension load) |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/credentials` | `X-Autom9-Token` | Upsert BYOM provider API key (encrypted) |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/credentials/{provider}` | `X-Autom9-Token` | Get masked credential status |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/config` | `X-Autom9-Token` | Upload + activate JSON workflow config |
| `GET` | `/api/config/workflow` | — | Get active workflow config (extension fetches on load) |

All error responses follow the envelope: `{"error": {"code": "...", "message": "..."}}`.

